# ===========================================================================
#  AIMetaAnalysis -- publication_v2 release scope
#
#  This directory is published as the DATA AND CODE repository backing the
#  manuscript's Data availability statement: the source data-extraction
#  workbook, the curated datasets, the full analysis pipeline, and every
#  numeric result it produces.
#
#  The manuscript itself -- main.tex, supplementary.tex, references.bib, the
#  compiled PDFs, and the generated tables/ + figures/ -- deliberately lives
#  OUTSIDE this repository (by default ../../manuscript_v2), so that it can
#  never be swept into the public release.  See README, "Where the manuscript
#  lives".
# ===========================================================================

# --- safety net: if a manuscript folder ever reappears in here, keep it out -
writeup/
manuscript_v2/

# --- author-side one-off quality-check helpers, not part of the pipeline -----
_verify_layout_only.py
_verify_table_data.py

